{"3299470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soup N' Shots", "steam_appid": 3299470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Soup N' Shots</i>, a cooperative game set in a post-apocalyptic world, your mission is to reclaim an abandoned farm—a beacon of hope in a desolate wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, plant and grow vegetables, cook soups and stews to keep your energy up, tune in to the radio to find out what is happening in the world, and work to the rhythm of the music. You can also explore the vast wasteland, hunt for food, meet other survivors, and discover safe shelters, always accompanied by your loyal dog, Tutuca. Uncover hidden secrets and unravel the mysteries lurking among the ruins of a world corrupted by its past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, everything changes. Dark and dangerous creatures emerge from beneath the ground, the music grows tense, and you will have to defend your farm with a powerful arsenal and a hearty dose of revitalizing soup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive and uncover the truth behind this devastated world? Hold your ground, because dawn is your only hope.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Soup N' Shots</i>, a cooperative game set in a post-apocalyptic world, your mission is to reclaim an abandoned farm—a beacon of hope in a desolate wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, plant and grow vegetables, cook soups and stews to keep your energy up, tune in to the radio to find out what is happening in the world, and work to the rhythm of the music. You can also explore the vast wasteland, hunt for food, meet other survivors, and discover safe shelters, always accompanied by your loyal dog, Tutuca. Uncover hidden secrets and unravel the mysteries lurking among the ruins of a world corrupted by its past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, everything changes. Dark and dangerous creatures emerge from beneath the ground, the music grows tense, and you will have to defend your farm with a powerful arsenal and a hearty dose of revitalizing soup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive and uncover the truth behind this devastated world? Hold your ground, because dawn is your only hope.</p>", "short_description": "In a post-apocalyptic world, reclaim an abandoned farm with your friends. By day, grow crops, explore the wasteland, and uncover its secrets. By night, defend the farm from dark creatures with a powerful arsenal and revitalizing soup. Will you survive until dawn?", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299470/header.jpg?t=1787537967", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299470/35b97405aec86e57f1b376a3d62fe3fe4fef0e91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787537967", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299470/35b97405aec86e57f1b376a3d62fe3fe4fef0e91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787537967", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10-11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-4130 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><